<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 68.7998 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 68.7998 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 68.7998 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 68.7989 on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    Sep 13		  Sep 12</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     68.7998		 68.7989</p>
<p> volume ($ million)		  1.170		   0.695</p>
<p> tenge per mark		 45.6680		 45.8694</p>
<p> volume (DM million)		 0.050		   0.310</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
